# dims_mm    : 39.0 x 21.0 x 3.2(nominal) mm -- X/Y measured from F.Fab, Z a flagged placeholder
# frame      : X = footprint-local +x, Y = -(footprint-local +y), Z = up, Z=0 at the board TOP face
# units      : 1 VRML unit = 2.54 mm (0.1 in) -- KiCad VRML convention; assign with (scale (xyz 1 1 1))
# source     : tracker/hardware/hub_board_v9.kicad_pcb footprint "balloon_flight_v9:LoRa2021F33_2G4" (Reference U2, Value "LoRa2021F33-2G4"): its own F.Fab outline measures 39.0 x 21.0 mm.  Reproduce every envelope with `/usr/bin/python3.14 scripts/footprint_envelope_probe.py tracker/hardware/hub_board_v9.kicad_pcb`.
# source     : docs/F33-MODULE-PLAN.md line 27: "| Module dimensions | 39 x 21 mm |" (from the NiceRF datasheet V1.1, confirmed against LCSC).
